bottom, This first bar here at

57
00:03:34,635 --> 00:03:36,679
737, you have point control right at the bottom.

58
00:03:37,636 --> 00:03:39,136
That's where the heaviest volume was.

59
00:03:39,336 --> 00:03:46,236
The market couldn't get past it. The market rallied and came back down, came near it, and rallied back up.

60
00:03:46,636 --> 00:03:48,461
But it's appearing down here at

61
00:03:48,461 --> 00:03:50,286
the bottom, and that's a sign

62
00:03:50,286 --> 00:03:53,936
that there was heavy volume down there transacting to support the market.

63
00:03:56,436 --> 00:03:58,452
Point of control near the top of a

64
00:03:58,452 --> 00:03:59,964
bar indicates that there's usually strong

65
00:03:59,964 --> 00:04:02,736
passive selling. in the form of offers working in the market.

66
00:04:03,336 --> 00:04:08,036
It's often strong enough to turn the market, at least temporarily, think of it again as stopping volume.

67
00:04:08,536 --> 00:04:13,436
So here, you see this bar at 719, you have the point of control right at the top.

